                                                <constraint firstAttribute="height" constant="240" id="cRx-Tx-jJh"/>
                                            </constraints>
                                            <string key="text">7. Overtime Pay Rate: $*__________ per hour 
For most workers in NYS this rate must be at least 1 ½ times the regular rate of pay, for all hours worked over 40 per workweek (44 hours for certain residential employees). The Temporary Help Firm should count all hours worked in all assignments during a workweek. Some assignments are only required to receive overtime pay at 1½ times the minimum wage. When you receive your assignment, your employer will tell you the overtime rate and the reason why if you are not eligible for overtime for that assignment.
* Teachers are not eligible for overtime because of their exempt status as teaching professionals under the Fair Labor Standards Act (FLSA)</string>
                                            <fontDescription key="fontDescription" type="system" pointSize="12"/>
                                            <nil key="textColor"/>
                                            <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                        </label>
