                                                    <rect key="frame" x="10" y="30" width="300" height="225"/>
                                                    <string key="text">I, test test"9,  pledge to prevent abuse, neglect, or harm toward any person with special needs. If I learn of, or witness, any incident of abuse, neglect or harm toward any person with special needs, I will offer immediate assistance and then notify emergency personnel, including 9-1-1 where appropriate, and inform the management of this organization. I pledge also to report the incident to the Justice Center for the Protection of People with Special Needs.

I acknowledge that I have read and that I understand the Code of Conduct.

I agree to abide by this Code of Conduct.

</string>
